Final QA Checklist
Before delivery, ensure:
- Content Accuracy: All facts match source docs. No slide contains unverified “TBD” facts without note.
- Consistency: Font sizes, colors, and bullet styles are uniform. Slide numbering and titles appear in same style.
- Spelling/Grammar: Proofread slide text and notes. Correct business names (e.g. “Antares”, “MS Amlin”).
- Accessibility: Check color contrast and font legibility. Add alt text to images/diagrams. Ensure slide masters have no hidden placeholder text.
- Brand Compliance: Use approved Marbleshore colors and logo. Confidential watermark/footer if needed (Safelite slide used “HIGHLY CONFIDENTIAL”).
- Technical: Ensure data tables (e.g. Partner list) are readable and fit on slide (split into columns if needed).
- Slide Flow: Verify that slide sequence tells a coherent story (not jumping topics abruptly).
